    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont see it. it feels more like i'm just a glitch in the system. like no matter how hard i try to play along, i'm always going to be the one person who doesn't make sense to everyone else. it's just constant, heavy... like i'm carrying this weight that never goes away.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
