    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just being lonely though. it's like the constant noise of trying to exist in a world that wasn't built for me. sometimes i just think... what if the only way to actually get some peace is to just stop? like, to just not have to deal with the weight anymore. is that even a normal thought to have?",
