      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a heartbreakingly common thought, and it doesn't make you broken—it makes you human under a crushing load. But \"stopping\" is not the only way to find peace; rest, distance, and tiny pockets of relief can ease the noise without ending the story. You don't have to solve everything today, but please don't carry this alone—reach out to someone who can sit with you in the dark, even for a few minutes. You deserve to find out what peace feels like while still being here.",
